[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11641.429, "timestamp": "03:14:01", "text": "不，我必须，我必须做点什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11644.55, "timestamp": "03:14:04", "text": "特地为此而设。所以，就在那时，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11647.11, "timestamp": "03:14:07", "text": "打开 Blender 的时候就像哭了一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11649.269, "timestamp": "03:14:09", "text": "百万加仑的眼泪试图"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11652.309, "timestamp": "03:14:12", "text": "把事情弄清楚，然后就像，嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11654.309, "timestamp": "03:14:14", "text": "那时我开始喜欢制作3D模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11658.15, "timestamp": "03:14:18", "text": "就像 YouTube 上的模特一样。嗯，还有这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11660.55, "timestamp": "03:14:20", "text": "这就是我现在全职从事的工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11663.03, "timestamp": "03:14:23", "text": "非常有趣。嗯，做3D建模工作量很大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11665.11, "timestamp": "03:14:25", "text": "很有趣。感觉总是有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11668.389, "timestamp": "03:14:28", "text": "每天都有新东西要学。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11671.269, "timestamp": "03:14:31", "text": "但同时也让人感到不知所措，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11673.429, "timestamp": "03:14:33", "text": "就像你会看到你会看到的一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11676.07, "timestamp": "03:14:36", "text": "可以肯定的是，人们喜欢的东西……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11677.99, "timestamp": "03:14:37", "text": "通过他们的模型实现目标"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11679.51, "timestamp": "03:14:39", "text": "多年以后，你会想，“我的天哪，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11681.51, "timestamp": "03:14:41", "text": "我想那样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11683.59, "timestamp": "03:14:43", "text": "嗯。但当我尝试去做的时候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11686.469, "timestamp": "03:14:46", "text": "就像是，“好吧，这有点……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11689.11, "timestamp": "03:14:49", "text": "难的。我们会得到它。”但我认为就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11691.11, "timestamp": "03:14:51", "text": "最令人满意的事情就像在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11693.349, "timestamp": "03:14:53", "text": "一切结束后，感觉就像是“地狱”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11699.11, "timestamp": "03:14:59", "text": "是的，我做过。哟，走吧。好的。"}]